{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2021-10-27 03:01:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX LEVELS UP UK DIGITAL ECONOMY WITH £61 MILLION MANCHESTER DATA CENTER', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF., OCT. 27, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO BUILD A NEW INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS EXCHANGE™ (IBX®) DATA CENTER IN THE AGECROFT COMMERCE PARK IN SALFORD, MANCHESTER, UK."}